---
description: Haven application architecture
alwaysApply: true
---

- Use the Next.js App Router under `src/app/`.
- Keep the common navigation shell in `src/components/haven-app.tsx`.
- Keep product pages in `src/components/pages/` and owned primitives in `src/components/ui/`.
- Route all mutable prototype data through `HavenDataProvider` and runtime schemas.
- Do not add Node, shell, or unrestricted filesystem access to client components.
- Real backend or authentication work requires a new architecture decision and replaces browser persistence.
- Major architecture changes require an ADR.
